{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011ChTY7VLGsB8wbLUKrvdNB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01N3yBAJAobjSS17144A8HbF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git status --short && cat spec/tickets/02-auditorium-map.md && echo ---- && cat apps/cinescope/src/styles.scss && echo ---- && cat apps/cinescope/src/app/app.spec.ts | head -50 && ls apps/cinescope && cat package.json | head -60","description":"Show git status, ticket 02, styles, package.json"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11839,"cache_read_input_tokens":28048,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11839,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JK4dFtrc8FqNwCijco2niZ","session_id":"451a05d2-90d8-4144-a8fc-cedf6ee810e9","uuid":"13eb6a62-0114-4602-a689-a875ef2b7b2d","timestamp":"2026-11-27T12:53:52.596Z","request_id":"req_011ChTY7V8chLJB42ZvPiRj8","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 03"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N3yBAJAobjSS17144A8HbF","type":"tool_result","content":" M apps/cinescope/src/app/app.config.ts\n M apps/cinescope/src/app/app.routes.ts\n M spec/tickets/01-movie-list.md\n M spec/tickets/02-auditorium-map.md\n?? .pnpm-store/\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/api.ts\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/dates.spec.ts\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/dates.ts\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/models.ts\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/seat-selection/\n# 02: Auditorium map\n\n**What to build:** `/screenings/:id/seats` loads the screening and its movie and draws the page header (title, show date, seat-limit text), the `SCREEN` bar and the auditorium: 15 rows with row labels on both edges, both aisles in every row, the entrance gap in rows 1–10, accessible seats in row 1 and 12 couches in row 15. Occupied seats are shown as unavailable. Selection comes in ticket 03. An unknown screening id redirects to `/`.\n\n**Specification:** sections 3.3, 5 (intro and layout), 5.1, 5.3 (colours of available, unavailable and accessible seats), 9.2, 9.7.\n\n**Blocked by:** 01 — Movie list and day picker.\n\n**Status:** done\n\n- [x] AC-05 — The seat map has 15 rows, numbered 1 to 15, row 1 rendered directly under the screen.\n- [x] AC-06 — Rows 11 to 15 contain 24 columns; rows 1 to 10 contain columns 5 to 24 only.\n- [x] AC-07 — A two-seat-wide gap is rendered between columns 4 and 5 and between columns 20 and 21 in every row; gaps carry no seat and no number.\n- [x] AC-08 — Column numbering is global 1–24 and identical across rows; in rows 1–10, numbering starts at 5.\n- [x] AC-09 — The row number is rendered on both the left and the right edge of every row.\n- [x] AC-10 — Every seat renders its column number.\n- [x] AC-11 — A `SCREEN` indicator is rendered above row 1.\n- [x] AC-12 — Row 1, columns 10 to 15 are accessible seats — 6 of them.\n- [x] AC-13 — Row 15 renders 12 couches, each spanning two adjacent columns: 1–2, 3–4, … 23–24.\n- [x] AC-14 — A couch is rendered as one wide element, visually distinct from a single seat.\n- [x] AC-15 — The total number of selectable elements in the auditorium is 308 (200 seats in rows 1–10, 96 in rows 11–14, 12 couches in row 15).\n- [x] AC-56 — The seat selection shows the title `Choose your seats` and the subtitle `Show Date: <Weekday> <D> <Mon> <HH:mm>` of the screening.\n- [x] AC-57 — Above the seat map, horizontally centred over it, the text `You can reserve up to 10 seats per reservation` is shown.\n----\n@use '@angular/material' as mat;\n\nhtml {\n  color-scheme: light;\n  @include mat.theme(\n    (\n      color: mat.$azure-palette,\n      typography: Roboto,\n      density: 0,\n    )\n  );\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\n}\n----\nimport { TestBed } from '@angular/core/testing';\nimport { App } from './app';\n\ndescribe('App', () => {\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    await TestBed.configureTestingModule({\n      imports: [App],\n    }).compileComponents();\n  });\n\n  it('should create', () => {\n    const fixture = TestBed.createComponent(App);\n    expect(fixture.componentInstance).toBeTruthy();\n  });\n});\neslint.config.mjs\nproject.json\npublic\nsrc\ntsconfig.app.json\ntsconfig.json\ntsconfig.spec.json\n{\n  \"name\": \"cinescope\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.0\",\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@11.1.0\",\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=26.5.0\",\n    \"pnpm\": \">=11.1.0\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"api\": \"json-server --watch db.json --port 3000\",\n    \"lint\": \"nx run-many -t lint\",\n    \"format\": \"prettier --write .\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@angular/build\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/cli\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/compiler-cli\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@eslint/js\": \"^9.39.5\",\n    \"@nx/angular\": \"23.1.1\",\n    \"@nx/eslint\": \"23.1.1\",\n    \"@nx/eslint-plugin\": \"23.1.1\",\n    \"@nx/web\": \"23.1.1\",\n    \"angular-eslint\": \"^22.0.0\",\n    \"eslint\": \"^9.39.5\",\n    \"jsdom\": \"^27.1.0\",\n    \"json-server\": \"0.17.4\",\n    \"nx\": \"23.1.1\",\n    \"prettier\": \"^3.8.1\",\n    \"sass\": \"^1.97.2\",\n    \"tslib\": \"^2.3.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"~6.0.3\",\n    \"typescript-eslint\": \"^8.69.0\",\n    \"vitest\": \"^4.0.8\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@angular/cdk\": \"~22.0.7\",\n    \"@angular/common\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/compiler\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/core\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/forms\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/material\": \"~22.0.7\",\n    \"@angular/platform-browser\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"@angular/router\": \"~22.0.4\",\n    \"rxjs\": \"~7.8.0\"\n  }\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JK4dFtrc8FqNwCijco2niZ","session_id":"451a05d2-90d8-4144-a8fc-cedf6ee810e9","uuid":"2de48a5c-6a3d-450f-b99f-ced9ecc3cdda","timestamp":"2026-11-27T12:53:52.627Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 03"}
