{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011ChTY7cqU54Nyc6SdUoDPZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JNd9sUbG7TkCN1ZJoP18Ea","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n 1,30p spec/tickets/04-booking-summary.md && echo ---- && cat apps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/movie-list.html && echo ---- && sed -n 1,40p spec/tickets/01-movie-list.md | head -12 && echo ---- && ls apps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list && cat apps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/movie-list.ts | head -80","description":"Read ticket 04 header, movie list template and component"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9722,"cache_read_input_tokens":39887,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9722,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JK4dFtrc8FqNwCijco2niZ","session_id":"451a05d2-90d8-4144-a8fc-cedf6ee810e9","uuid":"9734cb2f-4140-4327-a7b0-2f6088a7e020","timestamp":"2026-11-27T12:54:23.818Z","request_id":"req_011ChTY7cFFT7Vse7ytqzpSJ","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 03"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JNd9sUbG7TkCN1ZJoP18Ea","type":"tool_result","content":"# 04: Booking and summary\n\n**What to build:** The selection becomes a booking kept in `sessionStorage`. `Continue` takes the customer to the summary (`Your tickets`), which lists each ticket with its price, a `Remove` button and the total; `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact and `Cancel` on the seat map clears the booking. The summary and checkout routes redirect to `/` without a matching booking.\n\n**Specification:** sections 3.1, 5.4, 5.6, 6, 9.3, 9.7.\n\n**Blocked by:** 03 — Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel.\n\n**Status:** ready\n\n- [ ] AC-28 — Seats in rows 1–5 cost `25.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-29 — Seats in rows 6–10 cost `32.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-30 — Seats in rows 11–14 cost `39.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-31 — A couch costs `89.00 PLN` per couch, not per seat.\n- [ ] AC-32 — Accessible seats cost `25.00 PLN`, like the rest of row 1.\n- [ ] AC-33 — `Cancel` navigates to `/` and clears the selection.\n- [ ] AC-34 — `Continue` navigates to `/screenings/:id/summary`.\n- [ ] AC-35 — `Continue` does nothing when no seat is selected.\n- [ ] AC-36 — Each selected item is listed with movie title, screening date, time, row number, seat description and price.\n- [ ] AC-37 — A couch is described as `Couch <a>-<b>`; a single seat is described by its column number.\n- [ ] AC-38 — The total line reads `Total: <sum> PLN` and equals the sum of the listed prices.\n- [ ] AC-39 — `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact.\n- [ ] AC-40 — `Confirm` navigates to `/screenings/:id/checkout`.\n- [ ] AC-59 — The summary shows the title `Your tickets`.\n- [ ] AC-60 — Each summary item has a `Remove` button that removes it from the booking and updates the total; removing the last item returns to the seat map.\n- [ ] AC-67 — Every summary identifier in section 9.3 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n- [ ] The booking survives a reload of the seat map and of the summary.\n----\n<section class=\"movie-list-page\">\n  <div class=\"day-picker\" data-testid=\"day-picker\">\n    @for (day of days; track day.iso) {\n      @if (day.iso === selectedIso()) {\n        <button\n          mat-flat-button\n          data-testid=\"day-button\"\n          [attr.data-date]=\"day.iso\"\n          data-selected=\"true\"\n          (click)=\"selectDay(day.iso)\"\n        >\n          {{ day.label }}\n        </button>\n      } @else {\n        <button\n          mat-stroked-button\n          data-testid=\"day-button\"\n          [attr.data-date]=\"day.iso\"\n          data-selected=\"false\"\n          (click)=\"selectDay(day.iso)\"\n        >\n          {{ day.label }}\n        </button>\n      }\n    }\n\n    <mat-form-field class=\"date-field\" subscriptSizing=\"dynamic\">\n      <mat-label>Other date</mat-label>\n      <input\n        matInput\n        data-testid=\"date-picker\"\n        [matDatepicker]=\"picker\"\n        [min]=\"today\"\n        [value]=\"pickedDate()\"\n        (dateChange)=\"selectDate($event.value)\"\n      />\n      <mat-datepicker-toggle matIconSuffix [for]=\"picker\" />\n      <mat-datepicker #picker />\n    </mat-form-field>\n  </div>\n\n  @if (state() === 'loading') {\n    <div class=\"state\" data-testid=\"movies-loading\">\n      <mat-spinner diameter=\"32\" />\n      <span>Loading…</span>\n    </div>\n  } @else if (state() === 'error') {\n    <div class=\"state\">\n      <p data-testid=\"movies-error\">Failed to load movies</p>\n      <button mat-flat-button data-testid=\"movies-retry-button\" (click)=\"load()\">Retry</button>\n    </div>\n  } @else {\n    <div class=\"movie-list\" data-testid=\"movie-list\">\n      @for (entry of visibleMovies(); track entry.movie.id) {\n        <mat-card class=\"movie-card\" data-testid=\"movie-card\" [attr.data-movie-id]=\"entry.movie.id\">\n          <mat-card-content>\n            <h2 class=\"movie-title\" data-testid=\"movie-title\">{{ entry.movie.title }}</h2>\n            <div class=\"movie-meta\">\n              <span data-testid=\"movie-genre\">{{ entry.movie.genre }}</span>\n              <span data-testid=\"movie-runtime\">{{ entry.movie.runtimeMinutes }} min</span>\n              <span data-testid=\"movie-format\">{{ entry.movie.format }}</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"screenings\">\n              @for (screening of entry.screenings; track screening.id) {\n                <button\n                  mat-stroked-button\n                  data-testid=\"screening-button\"\n                  [attr.data-screening-id]=\"screening.id\"\n                  (click)=\"openScreening(screening.id)\"\n                >\n                  {{ screening.time }}\n                </button>\n              }\n            </div>\n          </mat-card-content>\n        </mat-card>\n      } @empty {\n        <p class=\"state\" data-testid=\"movies-empty\">No screenings on this day</p>\n      }\n    </div>\n  }\n</section>\n----\n# 01: Movie list and day picker\n\n**What to build:** A customer opens `/`, picks a day with the day picker (five day buttons and a datepicker), and sees the movies playing that day with their screening times, loaded from the backend, with loading, error and empty states. The selected day lives in the URL. Clicking a screening opens its seat map route. Also sets up the five routes from section 3 (screens 2–5 may be empty placeholders for now) and the redirect of unknown URLs to `/`.\n\n**Specification:** sections 1, 2, 3 (routes), 3.3, 4, 9.1.\n\n**Blocked by:** None (can start immediately).\n\n**Status:** done\n\n- [x] AC-01 — Without a chosen date, `/` shows today's screenings: one movie card per movie with a screening today.\n- [x] AC-02 — Each card shows title, genre, runtime in minutes and format (`PL dubbing` / `PL subtitles`).\n----\nmovie-list.html\nmovie-list.scss\nmovie-list.ts\nimport { HttpClient } from '@angular/common/http';\nimport { Component, DestroyRef, computed, inject, signal } from '@angular/core';\nimport { takeUntilDestroyed, toSignal } from '@angular/core/rxjs-interop';\nimport { MatButtonModule } from '@angular/material/button';\nimport { MatCardModule } from '@angular/material/card';\nimport { MatDatepickerModule } from '@angular/material/datepicker';\nimport { MatFormFieldModule } from '@angular/material/form-field';\nimport { MatInputModule } from '@angular/material/input';\nimport { MatProgressSpinnerModule } from '@angular/material/progress-spinner';\nimport { ActivatedRoute, Router } from '@angular/router';\nimport { forkJoin } from 'rxjs';\nimport { API_URL } from '../api';\nimport { WEEKDAYS, addDays, parseIsoDate, startOfDay, toIsoDate } from '../dates';\nimport { Movie, Screening } from '../models';\n\ntype LoadState = 'loading' | 'loaded' | 'error';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-movie-list',\n  imports: [MatButtonModule, MatCardModule, MatDatepickerModule, MatFormFieldModule, MatInputModule, MatProgressSpinnerModule],\n  templateUrl: './movie-list.html',\n  styleUrl: './movie-list.scss',\n})\nexport class MovieList {\n  private readonly http = inject(HttpClient);\n  private readonly router = inject(Router);\n  private readonly route = inject(ActivatedRoute);\n  private readonly destroyRef = inject(DestroyRef);\n\n  protected readonly today = startOfDay(new Date());\n\n  /** Today and the next four days, as shown in the day picker. */\n  protected readonly days = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4].map((offset) => {\n    const date = addDays(this.today, offset);\n    return { iso: toIsoDate(date), label: offset === 0 ? 'Today' : WEEKDAYS[date.getDay()] };\n  });\n\n  private readonly queryParams = toSignal(this.route.queryParamMap, { requireSync: true });\n\n  /** The `?date=` day if valid and not in the past, otherwise today. */\n  protected readonly selectedDate = computed(() => {\n    const requested = parseIsoDate(this.queryParams().get('date'));\n    return requested && requested >= this.today ? requested : this.today;\n  });\n  protected readonly selectedIso = computed(() => toIsoDate(this.selectedDate()));\n\n  /** The datepicker shows the date only when it is not one of the five day buttons. */\n  protected readonly pickedDate = computed(() =>\n    this.days.some((day) => day.iso === this.selectedIso()) ? null : this.selectedDate(),\n  );\n\n  protected readonly state = signal<LoadState>('loading');\n  private readonly movies = signal<Movie[]>([]);\n  private readonly screenings = signal<Screening[]>([]);\n\n  protected readonly visibleMovies = computed(() => {\n    const iso = this.selectedIso();\n    const dayScreenings = this.screenings().filter((screening) => screening.date === iso);\n    return this.movies()\n      .map((movie) => ({\n        movie,\n        screenings: dayScreenings\n          .filter((screening) => screening.movieId === movie.id)\n          .sort((a, b) => a.time.localeCompare(b.time)),\n      }))\n      .filter((entry) => entry.screenings.length > 0);\n  });\n\n  constructor() {\n    this.load();\n  }\n\n  protected load(): void {\n    this.state.set('loading');\n    forkJoin({\n      movies: this.http.get<Movie[]>(`${API_URL}/movies`),\n      screenings: this.http.get<Screening[]>(`${API_URL}/screenings`),\n    })\n      .pipe(takeUntilDestroyed(this.destroyRef))\n      .subscribe({","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JK4dFtrc8FqNwCijco2niZ","session_id":"451a05d2-90d8-4144-a8fc-cedf6ee810e9","uuid":"1bbf9a07-a79f-44c5-8ece-1207b41f3d0f","timestamp":"2026-11-27T12:54:23.851Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 03"}
