{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014hQ1dUe65GJmkBSfmnbRUq","type":"tool_result","content":"# Stack\n\nThe workspace is an Nx 23 monorepo. The application is the Nx project `cinescope` in\n`apps/cinescope`, generated with the Nx Angular application generator: **Angular 22**,\nstandalone components, zoneless, Angular Router with an empty route list, SCSS, Vitest for\nunit tests and ESLint. **Angular Material 22** and the Angular CDK are installed, a Material\ntheme is applied in `styles.scss`, and the native date adapter is provided for the\ndatepicker. It is ready to run; build the application on top of it.\n----\n# Tickets\n\nWork through the tickets in order. A ticket can start once every ticket in its\n**Blocked by** line is done. The specification is [`../README.md`](../README.md); each\nticket names the sections it implements and the acceptance criteria it must satisfy.\n\n| # | Ticket | Blocked by | Criteria |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 01 | [Movie list and day picker](01-movie-list.md) | — | 11 |\n| 02 | [Auditorium map](02-auditorium-map.md) | 01 | 13 |\n| 03 | [Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel](03-seat-selection.md) | 02 | 14 |\n| 04 | [Booking and summary](04-booking-summary.md) | 03 | 16 |\n| 05 | [Checkout and payment](05-checkout.md) | 04 | 13 |\n| 06 | [Confirmation and booking lifecycle](06-confirmation.md) | 05 | 2 |\n| 07 | [Final pass](07-final-pass.md) | 01–06 | all |\n\nA ticket is done when every box in it is ticked and `pnpm nx build cinescope` succeeds.\n----\n# 04: Booking and summary\n\n**What to build:** The selection becomes a booking kept in `sessionStorage`. `Continue` takes the customer to the summary (`Your tickets`), which lists each ticket with its price, a `Remove` button and the total; `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact and `Cancel` on the seat map clears the booking. The summary and checkout routes redirect to `/` without a matching booking.\n\n**Specification:** sections 3.1, 5.4, 5.6, 6, 9.3, 9.7.\n\n**Blocked by:** 03 — Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel.\n\n**Status:** ready\n\n- [ ] AC-28 — Seats in rows 1–5 cost `25.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-29 — Seats in rows 6–10 cost `32.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-30 — Seats in rows 11–14 cost `39.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-31 — A couch costs `89.00 PLN` per couch, not per seat.\n- [ ] AC-32 — Accessible seats cost `25.00 PLN`, like the rest of row 1.\n- [ ] AC-33 — `Cancel` navigates to `/` and clears the selection.\n- [ ] AC-34 — `Continue` navigates to `/screenings/:id/summary`.\n- [ ] AC-35 — `Continue` does nothing when no seat is selected.\n- [ ] AC-36 — Each selected item is listed with movie title, screening date, time, row number, seat description and price.\n- [ ] AC-37 — A couch is described as `Couch <a>-<b>`; a single seat is described by its column number.\n- [ ] AC-38 — The total line reads `Total: <sum> PLN` and equals the sum of the listed prices.\n- [ ] AC-39 — `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact.\n- [ ] AC-40 — `Confirm` navigates to `/screenings/:id/checkout`.\n- [ ] AC-59 — The summary shows the title `Your tickets`.\n- [ ] AC-60 — Each summary item has a `Remove` button that removes it from the booking and updates the total; removing the last item returns to the seat map.\n- [ ] AC-67 — Every summary identifier in section 9.3 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n- [ ] The booking survives a reload of the seat map and of the summary.\n----\napps/cinescope/src:\napp\nindex.html\nmain.ts\nstyles.scss\n\napps/cinescope/src/app:\napi.ts\napp.config.ts\napp.html\napp.routes.ts\napp.scss\napp.spec.ts\napp.ts\ndates.spec.ts\ndates.ts\nmodels.ts\nmovie-list\nseat-selection\ntoast.ts\n\napps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list:\nmovie-list.html\nmovie-list.scss\nmovie-list.ts\n\napps/cinescope/src/app/seat-selection:\nauditorium.spec.ts\nauditorium.ts\nseat-selection.html\nseat-selection.scss\nseat-selection.ts","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TuLQ4ngmNdgyyFYRo1pSPq","session_id":"451a05d2-90d8-4144-a8fc-cedf6ee810e9","uuid":"0045bc50-6990-414f-864c-41b9a1a5ec58","timestamp":"2026-11-27T12:56:18.399Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 04"}
