{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01REX8M5YKnLPv56CkLm1uC9","type":"tool_result","content":"# Stack\n\nThe workspace is an Nx 23 monorepo. The application is the Nx project `cinescope` in\n`apps/cinescope`, generated with the Nx Angular application generator: **Angular 22**,\nstandalone components, zoneless, Angular Router with an empty route list, SCSS, Vitest for\nunit tests and ESLint. **Angular Material 22** and the Angular CDK are installed, a Material\ntheme is applied in `styles.scss`, and the native date adapter is provided for the\ndatepicker. It is ready to run; build the application on top of it.\n----\n# Tickets\n\nWork through the tickets in order. A ticket can start once every ticket in its\n**Blocked by** line is done. The specification is [`../README.md`](../README.md); each\nticket names the sections it implements and the acceptance criteria it must satisfy.\n\n| # | Ticket | Blocked by | Criteria |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 01 | [Movie list and day picker](01-movie-list.md) | — | 11 |\n| 02 | [Auditorium map](02-auditorium-map.md) | 01 | 13 |\n| 03 | [Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel](03-seat-selection.md) | 02 | 14 |\n| 04 | [Booking and summary](04-booking-summary.md) | 03 | 16 |\n| 05 | [Checkout and payment](05-checkout.md) | 04 | 13 |\n| 06 | [Confirmation and booking lifecycle](06-confirmation.md) | 05 | 2 |\n| 07 | [Final pass](07-final-pass.md) | 01–06 | all |\n\nA ticket is done when every box in it is ticked and `pnpm nx build cinescope` succeeds.\n----\n# 06: Confirmation and booking lifecycle\n\n**What to build:** After a successful payment the customer sees the confirmation with their email address; `Continue` clears the booking and returns to `/`. The whole booking lifecycle from section 3.1 holds: it survives reloads, and every route guards against a missing or mismatched booking.\n\n**Specification:** sections 3.1, 8, 9.5.\n\n**Blocked by:** 05 — Checkout and payment.\n\n**Status:** ready\n\n- [ ] AC-48 — `/confirmation` shows `Payment successful` and `Your tickets will be sent shortly to <email>`; `Continue` navigates to `/` and clears the booking; the booking survives a reload via `sessionStorage`; entering the summary, checkout or confirmation without a matching booking redirects to `/`.\n- [ ] AC-69 — Every confirmation identifier in section 9.5 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n- [ ] Reloading `/confirmation` after paying still shows the confirmation.\n- [ ] After `Continue`, the seat map of the same screening shows no selected seats and the checkout form of a new booking is empty.\n----\nREADME.md\nstack.md\ntickets\napps/cinescope/src/app:\napi.ts\napp.config.ts\napp.html\napp.routes.ts\napp.scss\napp.spec.ts\napp.ts\nbooking.ts\ncheckout\ndates.spec.ts\ndates.ts\nmodels.ts\nmovie-list\nseat-selection\nsummary\ntickets.spec.ts\ntickets.ts\ntoast.ts\n\napps/cinescope/src/app/checkout:\ncheckout-form.spec.ts\ncheckout-form.ts\ncheckout.html\ncheckout.scss\ncheckout.spec.ts\ncheckout.ts\n\napps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list:\nmovie-list.html\nmovie-list.scss\nmovie-list.ts\n\napps/cinescope/src/app/seat-selection:\nauditorium.spec.ts\nauditorium.ts\nseat-selection.html\nseat-selection.scss\nseat-selection.ts\n\napps/cinescope/src/app/summary:\nsummary.html\nsummary.scss\nsummary.ts","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NfAHR2fPm1kASehZKanMEu","session_id":"451a05d2-90d8-4144-a8fc-cedf6ee810e9","uuid":"d30de742-a385-4ff8-87cf-4e14e124790f","timestamp":"2026-11-27T13:02:43.142Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 06"}
