{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LDVGvwtE6f8LAgMv7WBodW","type":"tool_result","content":":host {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.summary-page {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n  padding: 24px;\n}\n\n.title {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n\n.summary-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 720px;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.summary-item {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr auto auto auto auto;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n  padding: 8px 16px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: var(--mat-sys-surface-variant);\n}\n\n.item-title {\neslint.config.mjs\nproject.json\npublic\nsrc\ntsconfig.app.json\ntsconfig.json\ntsconfig.spec.json\n# 04: Booking and summary\n\n**What to build:** The selection becomes a booking kept in `sessionStorage`. `Continue` takes the customer to the summary (`Your tickets`), which lists each ticket with its price, a `Remove` button and the total; `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact and `Cancel` on the seat map clears the booking. The summary and checkout routes redirect to `/` without a matching booking.\n\n**Specification:** sections 3.1, 5.4, 5.6, 6, 9.3, 9.7.\n\n**Blocked by:** 03 — Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel.\n\n**Status:** done\n\n- [x] AC-28 — Seats in rows 1–5 cost `25.00 PLN`.\n- [x] AC-29 — Seats in rows 6–10 cost `32.00 PLN`.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NfAHR2fPm1kASehZKanMEu","session_id":"451a05d2-90d8-4144-a8fc-cedf6ee810e9","uuid":"713ef855-cbc4-49a3-b7fc-9e614a6faa80","timestamp":"2026-11-27T13:03:10.816Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 06"}
